From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 22:08:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe accept QCA 802.1Q DSA

The QCA8386 VLAN DSA transport exposes the same standalone VID contract as
the existing PPE DSA path. Accept it as an offloadable conduit and use the
standalone VID even when the switch user port is attached to a bridge. The
QCA VLAN tagger always transmits standalone VIDs; bridge-specific VIDs are
only valid for the VSC tagger path.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/qualcomm/ppe/ppe_flowtable.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/qualcomm/ppe/ppe_flowtable.c
@@ -1802,7 +1802,8 @@ static int ppe_ft_dsa_port(struct net_de
 	if (IS_ERR(dp))
 		return PTR_ERR(dp);
 
-	if (dp->cpu_dp->tag_ops->proto != DSA_TAG_PROTO_VSC73XX_8021Q)
+	if (dp->cpu_dp->tag_ops->proto != DSA_TAG_PROTO_VSC73XX_8021Q &&
+	    dp->cpu_dp->tag_ops->proto != DSA_TAG_PROTO_QCA_8021Q)
 		return -EOPNOTSUPP;
 
 	if (!edma_port_dev_check(dsa_port_to_conduit(dp)))
@@ -1814,7 +1815,8 @@ static int ppe_ft_dsa_port(struct net_de
 	if (dpp)
 		*dpp = dp;
 
-	if (dsa_port_bridge_dev_get(dp))
+	if (dp->cpu_dp->tag_ops->proto == DSA_TAG_PROTO_VSC73XX_8021Q &&
+	    dsa_port_bridge_dev_get(dp))
 		return dsa_tag_8021q_bridge_vid(dsa_port_bridge_num_get(dp));
 
 	return dsa_tag_8021q_standalone_vid(dp);
